</div></section><section id="s19"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Data Availability.</h2>
<p>Anonymized data have been deposited in OpenNeuro (<a href="https://openneuro.org/" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://openneuro.org/</a>) under the accession no. <a href="https://openneuro.org/datasets/ds003095" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ds003095</a>. Analysis scripts are available in Github at <a href="https://github.com/ycleong/Polarization/" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://github.com/ycleong/Polarization/</a>.</p></section><section id="ref-list1" class="ref-list"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">References</h2>
